# Discord Music Bot

A Discord music bot built with Node.js, Discord.js,
@discordjs/voice, FFmpeg and Audius API.

## Features

- Play music from Audius
- Queue system
- Pause / Resume
- Skip
- Previous
- Restart
- Shuffle
- Loop track / queue
- Search
- Playback history
- Multiple guild support

## Technologies

- Node.js
- JavaScript
- Discord.js
- @discordjs/voice
- Axios
- FFmpeg
- Audius API

## Architecture

commands/  → Discord commands
services/  → business logic and external APIs
index.js   → application entry point

## Installation

npm install

Create .env file:

DISCORD_TOKEN=
AUDIUS_API_KEY=
CLIENT_ID=
GUILD_ID=

Install FFmpeg and make sure it is available in PATH.

Register commands:

node deploy-commands.js

Start bot:

node index.js